+/*
+ * Dates that lie in the future by more than limit_ms - now_ms: a file or a
+ * tombstone written while the clock was wrong. Such a date wins every
+ * comparison until that day comes. The file gets the date now_ms, on disk
+ * and in the database; *dirty is set when something was changed. Only to
+ * be called when the clock is known to be right (see the caller).
